' Observed behavior: blocking MVC boundaries delegate execution to the agent engine and stream through bounded SSE subscribers.
' Observed behavior: root messages.properties and messages_zh_CN.properties rely on the default Spring Boot message source.
' Target-only design: explicit en_US and zh_CN bundles live under i18n and an explicit MessageSource loads them.
